{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate the maze! To reach the end of each maze to keep the world's gears of time and space moving.<br><br>Unlock abilities that will make your maze exploration easier, as you total up star gears from each maze!<br><br> <strong>You can turn on/off the Pigeon Hole Masking in the Settings, it is meant to reduce dizziness, but you can only see the maze like seeing through a peeping hole.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/1f86c77b9794cf6914aa472ca980ea91.poster.avif?t=1765161841\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/1f86c77b9794cf6914aa472ca980ea91.webm?t=1765161841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/1f86c77b9794cf6914aa472ca980ea91.mp4?t=1765161841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br> <strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate to move!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/d73d558969cce27d8cc966630f51ddc8.poster.avif?t=1765161841\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/d73d558969cce27d8cc966630f51ddc8.webm?t=1765161841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/d73d558969cce27d8cc966630f51ddc8.mp4?t=1765161841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect star gears!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/6df17de1b80bcaa864dbafcc7b048446.poster.avif?t=1765161841\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/6df17de1b80bcaa864dbafcc7b048446.webm?t=1765161841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/6df17de1b80bcaa864dbafcc7b048446.mp4?t=1765161841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the maze with star gears to progressively gain quality of life maze clearing abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/a84918d80ffc7498fbe5b6adca6c9ace.poster.avif?t=1765161841\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/a84918d80ffc7498fbe5b6adca6c9ace.webm?t=1765161841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/a84918d80ffc7498fbe5b6adca6c9ace.mp4?t=1765161841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Play higher difficulty if you want to feel challenged! (difficulty is more impactful on levels after level 5)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/b6db8745e9e3a47b7fe1dfe2764f73f7.poster.avif?t=1765161841\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/b6db8745e9e3a47b7fe1dfe2764f73f7.webm?t=1765161841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/b6db8745e9e3a47b7fe1dfe2764f73f7.mp4?t=1765161841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 Levels to play! 10 levels in each area!<strong> 5 area of mazes to complete! </strong><br><u>Grasslands area</u> - Just plain old mazes. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/1831ad32940ab72177ff6bd0bdcffd3f.poster.avif?t=1765161841\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/1831ad32940ab72177ff6bd0bdcffd3f.webm?t=1765161841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/1831ad32940ab72177ff6bd0bdcffd3f.mp4?t=1765161841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Beaches area</u>\u00a0- Mazes in addition of keys, locks and fake blocks.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/857199485b6f2f5942eef87240c043de.poster.avif?t=1765161841\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/857199485b6f2f5942eef87240c043de.webm?t=1765161841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/857199485b6f2f5942eef87240c043de.mp4?t=1765161841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><u>Oceans area</u>\u00a0- Mazes in addition of dimensional currents and portals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/17519be98de74edcbaebd5b5063828ef.poster.avif?t=1765161841\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/17519be98de74edcbaebd5b5063828ef.webm?t=1765161841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/extras/17519be98de74edcbaebd5b5063828ef.mp4?t=1765161841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>(to be updated) <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game contains 3 endings<br> <br><strong>Story</strong> <br>G.O.T.S(Gear Of Time &amp; Space) has awakened. Not knowing what it really is, but it knows that it wants to keep the world's gears running.     <br> <br>The remaining gears are wearing out, and they do not have any way to repair themselves. Play as G.O.T.S to repair the gear systems that runs the world!<br> <br><strong>Difficulty</strong> <br><strong>Normal -</strong>\u00a0No time limit, take as long as you need to clear the maze.  <br><strong>Hard -</strong>\u00a0Time limit and have to collect all of the star gears the maze contains.  <br><strong>Extreme -</strong> Includes previous difficulty, and an enemy that chases and neutralizes you.  <br>   <br>   <br>  Game was designed for Portrait mobile phones, but I have tested for square and landscape screens as well. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959830?t=1765161841","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959830?t=1765161841","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/c72f0108db0a85b4c8efc242e113a2d9183b96e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765161841","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959830/c72f0108db0a85b4c8efc242e113a2d9183b96e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765161841","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound"